            <h1 class="reveal" style="font-size: 4rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.04em;">Engineering with <span style="background: var(--gradient-tech); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">depth</span> and intent</h1>
