                <h4 style="color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Outcomes over output</h4>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Velocity is meaningless without measurable business impact. We optimize for the latter.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card reveal" style="background: var(--bg-card); backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur); border: 1px solid var(--border-glass); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);">
                <h4 style="color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">AI with guardrails</h4>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Data, retrieval, and tool-use done well. No demos that fall apart in production.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card reveal" style="background: var(--bg-card); backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur); border: 1px solid var(--border-glass); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);">
                <h4 style="color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Boring tech, sharp execution</h4>
                <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">Postgres, TypeScript, edge SSR. Proven foundations. Excellent execution.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Stack Section -->
    <section class="section-padding container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
            <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1); color: var(--accent-cyan); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
