            </div>
            <h2 class="reveal" style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">The <span style="background: var(--gradient-tech); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">stack</span></h2>
